      "review_description": "So far, it is going well and I expect to be fully operational in the next 2 weeks - I'm happy to provide you with more info.The salesperson actually listened to what I was trying to achieve (islanding due to inconsistent power supply), lives in the local area (so understands the local brown outs and climate issues) and worked with me to identify my energy needs.I have an update regarding my review of Tempco (Apr 22, 2014), sadly I'm having issues with servicing. The system has performed magnificently over this summer - providing me with 'free' air conditioning and the lowest electricity bill I've had in 20 years. However, my inverter has a fault and I'm sad to say the service post-installation is pathetic. A real half-star effort. nearly 2 months and I'm still waiting to get it fixed! The excuse is the weather. Hmm - its an indoor inverter!",
